{"slug":"langley-community-activities-to-explore-in-february-and-march-2025-8423107","path":"/blog.html/langley-community-activities-to-explore-in-february-and-march-2025-8423107","url":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/langley-community-activities-to-explore-in-february-and-march-2025-8423107","kind":"blog","title":"Langley Community Activities to Explore in February and March 2025","canonical":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/langley-community-activities-to-explore-in-february-and-march-2025-8423107","seo":{"Title":"Langley Community Activities to Explore in February and March 2025","Meta description":"Discover upcoming community activities and local events in Langley this February and March 2025, from family-friendly outings to seasonal happenings.","H1":"Langley Community Activities: February and March 2025","Canonical":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/langley-community-activities-to-explore-in-february-and-march-2025-8423107","Meta robots":"","OG title":"Langley Community Activities: February and March 2025","OG description":"Discover upcoming community activities and local events in Langley this February and March 2025, from family-friendly outings to seasonal happenings.","OG image":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/wps/rest/64736/blog/qqqx/qqqxkhubxbcf.jpg","Published":"2025-02-27T02:54:18+00:00","Modified":"2026-02-06T11:45:21+00:00"},"blocks":[{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"RSS","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.feed"}]},{"t":"h","level":1,"text":"Langley Community Activities: February and March 2025"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Posted on"},{"t":"February 26, 2025"},{"t":"by"},{"t":"Jared Gibbons","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/about.html"}],"cls":"byline"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Langley","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/?p=42126&preview=true"},{"t":"offers a variety of community activities in February and March. Whether you enjoy book clubs, creative play for kids, or board games, there’s something for everyone. Below is a list of exciting events to keep you entertained."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"February 2025"},{"t":"Langley Community","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/?p=42126&preview=true"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Activities"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Start the year with engaging activities! The"},{"t":"“Between the Pages” Book Club","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":"at Brookswood Library lets book lovers connect and share their latest reads. At Muriel Arnason Library, the"},{"t":"“Write a Letter to a Book Character”","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":"event encourages creativity for all ages."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Board game enthusiasts can visit the"},{"t":"Scrabble Club","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":"at Murrayville Library for friendly competition. For parents with young children,"},{"t":"Sensory Playtime","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":"at Murrayville Library offers interactive learning for babies aged 0-2. Adults can also enjoy literary discussions at the"},{"t":"Afternoon Book Club at Aldergrove Library","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":"."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"March 2025"},{"t":"Langley Community","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/?p=42126&preview=true"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Activities"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"March brings even more opportunities for fun and learning. The"},{"t":"Dungeons & Dragons","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":"for Adults event at Murrayville Library is perfect for role-playing game fans. If you're interested in financial planning, attend the"},{"t":"Effective Tax Strategies workshop","h":"https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed-income-tax.html"},{"t":"on March 5 at Murrayville Library. Professional accountants will provide expert advice."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"For kids, creative activities include"},{"t":"Kids’ Crafternoon","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"LEGO Building","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":"at Aldergrove Library. Chess lovers of all ages can test their strategic skills at the"},{"t":"Chess Club","h":"https://fvrl.bibliocommons.com/events"},{"t":", also at Aldergrove Library."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Discover the Best"},{"t":"Langley Community","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/?p=42126&preview=true"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Activities"},{"t":"Langley’s community","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/?p=42126&preview=true"},{"t":"calendar is packed with diverse events. From educational workshops to game nights, there’s always something exciting to do. Mark your calendars and invite your friends and family to join the fun!"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Blogs"},{"t":"All Blog Posts","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html"}]},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"New Listings","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86690"}],[{"t":"Open Houses","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86691"}],[{"t":"Real Estate Blog","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=82607"}],[{"t":"Sold Listings","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86692"}]]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Posts By Date"},{"t":"Most Recent","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html"}]},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"October 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/10/"}],[{"t":"September 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/09/"}],[{"t":"August 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/08/"}],[{"t":"July 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/07/"}],[{"t":"June 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/06/"}],[{"t":"May 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/05/"}],[{"t":"April 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/04/"}],[{"t":"March 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/03/"}],[{"t"